<title>USA: Metromedia expands Uzbekistan venture.</title>
<headline>Metromedia expands Uzbekistan venture.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metromedia International Group said on Wednesday that its joint venture with the Ministry of Communications of Uzbekistan has begun its first phase of a nationwide paging expansion in Uzbekistan.</p>
<p>This first phase of the joint venture, Kamalak Paging, will double the original four million population coverage, the company said.</p>
<p>Kamalak Paging will eventually cover 75 percent of the 22 million population in Uzbekistan, Metromedia said.</p>
</text>
